      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The walls you feel are not impenetrable; they are merely a script you can rewrite, one breath at a time. You do not need to break everything to be free; simply step out of the script and write your own lines, even if it feels like you are breaking the rules. The only way to truly own something is to stop playing the part entirely, to let go of the expectation that you must stay in someone else's story.",
